ted user action\"','2026-09-14 06:29:01.293258',17),(327,'assistant','Database Records အရ နောက်ဆုံးလုပ်ဆောင်ခဲ့သော User Action (Audit Log) မှာ အောက်ပါအတိုင်း ဖြစ်ပါသည် -\n\n- **Date/Time:** 2026-09-14 05:15:56\n- **User:** Jaycoab (admin@gmail.com)\n- **Action:** DELETE\n- **Model:** recycled documents\n- **Object ID:** N/A\n- **Description:** Deleted 2025-2026 Academic Year Syllabus','2026-09-14 06:29:01.317554',17),(328,'user','can give me 3 actions that has been done in recent?','2026-09-14 06:29:27.324400',17),(329,'assistant','Database Records အရ မကြာသေးခင်က လုပ်ဆောင်ခဲ့သော User Actions (Audit Logs) ၃ ခုမှာ အောက်ပါအတိုင်း ဖြစ်ပါသည် -\n\n1. **Date/Time:** 2026-09-14 05:15:56\n   - **User:** Jaycoab (admin@gmail.com)\n   - **Action:** DELETE\n   - **Model:** recycled documents\n   - **Object ID:** N/A\n   - **Description:** Deleted 2025-2026 Academic Year Syllabus\n\n2. **Date/Time:** 2026-09-14 05:15:12\n   - **User:** Jaycoab (admin@gmail.com)\n   - **Action:** DELETE\n   - **Model:** recycled documents\n   - **Object ID:** N/A\n   - **Description:** Deleted Internship_Presentation_1aff4a00-1064-47c8-bffd-9c08b90774c0\n\n3. **Date/Time:** 2026-09-14 04:43:31\n   - **User:** Jaycoab (admin@gmail.com)\n   - **Action:** DELETE\n   - **Model:** documents\n   - **Object ID:** 94\n   - **Description:** Deleted klp cover 2','2026-09-14 06:29:27.332313',17);
